{"nodes": [{"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_collaborator_note_collaborator_note", "label": "Collaborator's note \u2014 'Nothing is something definable'", "file_type": "document", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-collaborator-note.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_collaborator_note_errors_converted_to_structure", "label": "The register is evidence that errors were converted into structure", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-collaborator-note.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Not that the work was error-prone: 1,629 entries over three populations, each recorded with what caught it."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_collaborator_note_write_before_reading_failure", "label": "Writing conclusions before reading the output \u2014 the recurring failure", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-collaborator-note.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "It happens as readily on six cells as on 1,442, so it is not a failure of attention and no amount of care fixes it; \u00a72.14 exists because the failure was measured rather than deplored."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_collaborator_note_wrong_nuclear_charge", "label": "The wrong nuclear charge \u2014 the object caught what care could not", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-collaborator-note.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The bracket held 56 of 56 and could not notice, because Z cancels out of the containment test; two quantities the method never uses were loud with it at once. The object found the error because it carried more than it needed."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_collaborator_note_corrupted_input_class", "label": "The error class no structure can catch \u2014 a corrupted input with consistent downstream", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-collaborator-note.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Every relation checked out and every number agreed, and all of it was wrong. What reached it was being asked to look again, which is why a collaborator is not optional."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_collaborator_note_four_refused_conclusions", "label": "Four results that exist because a conclusion was refused", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-collaborator-note.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "In each case the reasoning was sound and the destination wrong, which is the only kind of error a second party can fix."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_collaborator_note_nothing_is_something_definable", "label": "Nothing is something definable \u2014 the 14D null", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-collaborator-note.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A null is still definable: its definition does not come from inside the cell but from an observation made outside it. Reading the null from outside is what turned it into something with a definition."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_collaborator_note_d_def_d_phys_split", "label": "The split of self-defence \u2014 \u2145_phys against a wrong value, \u2145_def against a wrong derivation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-collaborator-note.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A relation that cannot be violated by data is not empty \u2014 it is defending the derivation that produced it, checking that a quantity reached one way agrees with the same quantity reached another."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_collaborator_note_negative_results", "label": "The negative results are the strongest chapters", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-collaborator-note.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "1,061 perturbation bounds from a bracket's non-failure, an impossibility proof from a fruitless counter-example search, a structural exclusion from four modes of decline \u2014 negative because a nothing was defined rather than discarded."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_collaborator_note_prior_art_rediscovery", "label": "Nine things derived from scratch that were already in print", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-collaborator-note.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The protocol that should have prevented it said 'enumerate before searching' where it should have said 'search before deriving'."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_collaborator_note_audit_wrong_artefact", "label": "An audit that reads the wrong artefact will pass anything", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-collaborator-note.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "107 blank boxes across 44 pages while every audit reported clean, because all of them read the source text and none read the finished page."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_collaborator_note_redundancy_of_paths", "label": "Redundancy of paths, not redundancy of care", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-collaborator-note.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The protocols were written and broken by the same person in the same week; what saved the results is that four different things were looking, and they were not looking at the same thing."}, {"id": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_collaborator_note_register_1629", "label": "The 1,629 register entries \u2014 material, not confession", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-collaborator-note.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null}], "edges": [{"source": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_collaborator_note_collaborator_note", "target": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_collaborator_note_errors_converted_to_structure", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-collaborator-note.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_collaborator_note_collaborator_note", "target": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_collaborator_note_write_before_reading_failure", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-collaborator-note.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_collaborator_note_collaborator_note", "target": "drive_the_method_materials_rewrite_collaborator_note_wrong_nuclear_charge", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1.0, "source_file": "drive/The Method Materials/REWRITE-collaborator-note.md", "source_location": null, "weight": 1.0}, {"source": "drive_the_method_materials_rewri